
Step 1 — Create Director SNS Topic

aws sns create-topic ^
  --name WNXT-Prod-ASG-Events ^
  --region us-east-1

arn:aws:sns:us-east-1:604009108246:WNXT-Prod-ASG-Events 


Step 2 — Subscribe Director


aws sns subscribe ^
  --topic-arn arn:aws:sns:us-east-1:604009108246:WNXT-Prod-ASG-Events ^
  --protocol email ^
  --notification-endpoint choobab@ganz.com ^
  --region us-east-1


Step 3 — Attach SNS to ASG Lifecycle Notifications

aws autoscaling put-notification-configuration ^
  --auto-scaling-group-name WNXT-PROD-USER-ASG ^
  --topic-arn arn:aws:sns:us-east-1:604009108246:WNXT-Prod-ASG-Events ^
  --notification-types ^
    autoscaling:EC2_INSTANCE_LAUNCH ^
    autoscaling:EC2_INSTANCE_TERMINATE ^
  --region us-east-1


What Director Will Receive
On Scale Out:
Subject: Auto Scaling: launch for group WNXT-PROD-USER-ASG
  → New instance launched
  → Instance ID
  → Availability Zone
On Scale In:
Subject: Auto Scaling: terminate for group WNXT-PROD-USER-ASG
  → Instance terminated
  → Instance ID
  → Availability Zone

Verify

aws autoscaling describe-notification-configurations ^
  --auto-scaling-group-names WNXT-PROD-USER-ASG ^
  --region us-east-1